.TH TUDUCONVERT 1 "October 2026" "tudumd 0.10.5" "User Manuals"
.SH NAME
tuduconvert \- bidirectional converter between TuDu XML and tudumd Markdown files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tuduconvert
\fIinput.xml\fR \fIoutput.md\fR
.br
.B tuduconvert
\fIinput.md\fR \fIoutput.xml\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBtuduconvert\fR is a standalone converter utility included with \fBtudumd\fR(1)
that converts hierarchical TODO lists between legacy \fBTuDu\fR XML (\fB.xml\fR)
and \fBtudumd\fR Markdown (\fB.md\fR) in both directions without losing any task
metadata (hierarchy, done state, collapse state, priority, categories, deadline,
scheduled date, scheduled order, or multi-line descriptions).
.PP
When converting from XML to Markdown (\fB.xml \(-> .md\fR), \fBtuduconvert\fR also
reads \fBsort_order\fR from \fI$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/tudumd/tudumdrc\fR
(\fI~/.config/tudumd/tudumdrc\fR), \fI~/.tudumdrc\fR, \fI~/.tudurc\fR, or
\fI/etc/tudumdrc\fR (defaulting to \fBlpu\fR: deadline, priority, user order)
so the generated Markdown document is ordered identically to the \fBtudumd\fR TUI view.
.SH OPTIONS
.IP "\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR"
Display usage instructions and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
Convert an existing legacy \fI~/.tudu.xml\fR file to the XDG default location:
.PP
.nf
.RS
tuduconvert ~/.tudu.xml ~/.local/share/tudumd/tudu.md
.RE
.fi
.PP
Export a \fBtudumd\fR Markdown file back to legacy XML format:
.PP
.nf
.RS
tuduconvert ~/.local/share/tudumd/tudu.md backup.xml
.RE
.fi
.SH FILES
.IP "\fI$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/tudumd/tudumdrc\fR, \fI~/.tudumdrc\fR, \fI~/.tudurc\fR, \fI/etc/tudumdrc\fR"
Read to determine the \fBsort_order\fR when converting from XML to Markdown.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tudumd (1)
